   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to PACANET</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to PACANET</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims at fostering better coordination, increased capacity, enhanced quality service delivery, networking, collaboration and resource mobilisation within the Church. Targets Christian organisations and churches with HIV/AIDS programmes. The local church is targeted through various church mother bodies. Special efforts made to ensure that women and youth leaders participate.</narrative>
